10:T6b8,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this an agency?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. There's no account team, no strategy retainer, no minimum scoped for a brand ten times your size. It's a dedicated outside creative partner who plugs into your existing team and delivers finished content every month."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"We're a restaurant / spa / venue, not a hotel. Does this still apply?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Hotels are our anchor, but the same model covers hotel restaurants, standalone F&B, spas and wellness studios, and wedding and event venues. The deliverables shift to match, menu features, treatment promos, event creative, but the workflow is identical."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What do you need from us each month?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Surprisingly little: whatever's coming up (events, menu changes, offers) and any new photos you have. We handle planning, design, motion, and captions from there. Most clients spend under an hour a month on the whole relationship."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you keep multiple properties consistent?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, that's a core use case. Group-level brand consistency with property-level customization, one plan, one invoice. Groups of 5+ properties get custom scoping."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does it cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A fixed monthly fee that lands well under the loaded cost of an in-house hire, see the cost savings page for the full comparison, or the packages page for current tiers. The free 5-asset trial comes first either way."}}]}5:["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}]
