7:["$","main",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-24","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"pt-16 md:pt-20","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#C9A44C]","children":"Hospitality Creative Support"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-3xl font-serif text-[clamp(30px,4.5vw,52px)] font-semibold leading-tight","children":"A creative department for hospitality teams that can't justify one."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#A9A092]","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"Hotels, restaurants, spas, and venues all hit the same wall: the business generates endless content-worthy moments, new menus, weddings, seasonal packages, renovated rooms, but nobody on the team has the time or the tools to turn those moments into finished marketing assets. The choice usually looks like a $90K+ in-house hire, an agency retainer scoped for brands twice your size, or a rotating cast of freelancers who need re-briefing every month."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Archer Design is the fourth option: a dedicated outside creative partner who learns your brand once, then delivers polished, approval-ready content every month. Social graphics, short-form video, captions, campaign copy, and promo assets, built from the photos and details you already have."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"One partner, one fixed monthly fee, no employment overhead. The work shows up finished; your team approves and posts."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L11",null,{"href":"/hotel-creative-scorecard","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#1a1407] shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(201,164,76,0.22)] transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_6px_32px_rgba(201,164,76,0.4)]","style":{"background":"linear-gradient(135deg, #E8D7A2, #C